'- `export/results.tar.gz`: original remote results archive (8,321,484 bytes); `results-repaired.tar.gz` also includes the recovered provenance source in every run.',
'- `export/checkpoints.tar`: original final-checkpoint archive (9,700,812,800 bytes); model, optimizer, RNG/runtime, metadata and checksum marker for each of the 14 final checkpoints.',
'- `pilots/`: downloaded v5 pilot directory, including the numerical preflight and all eight pilot bundles/checkpoints. All 281 files match the remote inventory sizes; all eight pilot checkpoint checksum sets pass.',
'- `export/tokenizer/`: tokenizer assets, checked against the final-run manifest.',
